[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":112},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-7up-graduate-trainee-program-2026-nigeria-career-opportunities-103":3},{"news":4,"more":29},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":21,"notifiedBy":22,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":23,"categories":24,"readTime":26},103,"7up-graduate-trainee-program-2026-nigeria-career-opportunities-103","7up Graduate Trainee Program 2026 Nigeria: Career Opportunities","\u003Cp>Applications are now being accepted from all qualified and interested Nigerians for the 2026 7Up Graduate Trainee Program.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>7Up Graduate Trainee Program Abstract\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Host: 7\u003Cem>up\u003C\u002Fem> Bottling Company\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships-and-opportunities\u002Finternships\u002F\">Internships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships-and-opportunities\u002Ftrainings\u002F\">Trainings\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Monthly Salary\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Training\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Employment\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Networking\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Deadline: Not Specified\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>7Up Graduate Trainee Program 2026 Details\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Applications for the 7Up Graduate Trainee Program 2026 have commenced. All interested Nigerian graduates are invited to benefit from this golden opportunity.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Seven-Up Bottling Company Limited is one of the largest manufacturing companies in Nigeria, producing and distributing some of the favourite most- loved soft drink brands in the country like; 7up, Pepsi, Mirinda, Mountain Dew, H2oH!, Teem, Lipton Ice Tea and Aquafina premium drinking water.’\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>7Up Graduate Trainee Program Benefits\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>As a Graduate Trainee, you will embark on a transformative journey designed to provide you with invaluable learning and mentoring opportunities.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Our multi-disciplinary experienced professionals will guide and support you as you navigate the early years of your professional life.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Through our rotation scheme, you will have the chance to gather knowledge from various aspects of the business, enabling you to discover where your strengths lie and where you can excel.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Responsibilities for 7Up Graduate Trainee Program:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Participate actively in training sessions and workshops to develop essential skills and industry knowledge.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Collaborate with experienced professionals in different departments to gain a holistic understanding of our organization.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Contribute to projects, apply your expertise, and showcase your innovative ideas to make a tangible impact.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Embrace a proactive approach to problem-solving, ensuring the continuous improvement of our processes and services.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Engage with mentors and seek feedback to foster personal and professional growth.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Demonstrate a strong commitment to delivering excellence in all your endeavors.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Participate in team meetings, brainstorming sessions, and knowledge-sharing activities to promote a culture of collaboration and creativity.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Stay up-to-date with industry trends and developments to contribute fresh perspectives to our team.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>7Up Graduate Trainee Program Requirements\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the 7Up Graduate Trainee Program, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Possess a minimum Second-Class Upper Division from a recognized university.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Hold a Bachelor’s degree \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have completed NYSC\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Possess 0-2 years of relevant work experience.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Demonstrate excellence in research and writing abilities.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have strong communication and presentation skills.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be proficient in Microsoft Office applications (Word, PowerPoint, Excel).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Possess strong analytical, critical thinking, and problem-solving skills.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Show Willingness to work in any of the company’s locations within and outside Nigeria.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Required Documents\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>While applying for the 2026 7Up Graduate Trainee Program, you will be required to submit the following documents;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fsevenup.seamlesshiring.com\u002Fjob\u002Fview\u002F8831?utm_source=ScholarsWorld%20Website#\u002F\">APPLY HERE: https:\u002F\u002Fsevenup.seamlesshiring.com\u002Fjob\u002Fview\u002F8831?utm_source=ScholarsWorld%20Website#\u002F\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-03-27 11:36:57",null,[16],{"fileName":17,